---
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const {compact=false}=Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={['infra-entry',{compact}]} aria-label="贝位堆场与机房专题"><div><span class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE OPERATION</span><h2>箱位、堆场和机房，连起来看。</h2><p>箱子在哪，怎么移，信息靠什么运行？用三个图解专题认识作业背后的组织方式。</p><a class="text-link" href={base+'infrastructure/'}>进入专题全景 →</a></div><div class="infra-entry-links">{[['bay','贝位与箱位','找准船上与场内的位置'],['yard','堆场组织与演进','比较设备、空间与移箱'],['it-room','IT 机房与硬件','认识服务器、网络与供电']].map(([id,title,desc],i)=><a href={base+'infrastructure/'+id+'/'}><span>0{i+1}</span><strong>{title}</strong><small>{desc}</small></a>)}</div></section>
<style>.infra-entry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:36px;padding:30px;background:#f0f3ee;border:1px solid #d8dfd7;border-radius:12px;margin:30px 0}.infra-entry h2{font-size:24px;margin:12px 0}.infra-entry p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#626e65;margin:0 0 14px}.infra-entry-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.infra-entry-links a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;background:#fcfcf8;border:1px solid #d6ddd6;padding:20px 15px;border-radius:8px}.infra-entry-links a:hover{border-color:#315b50}.infra-entry-links span{font:12px monospace;color:#678276}.infra-entry-links strong{font-size:15px}.infra-entry-links small{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#6a786d}.infra-entry.compact{padding:24px}.infra-entry.compact h2{font-size:21px}@media(max-width:900px){.infra-entry{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}}@media(max-width:600px){.infra-entry{padding:22px}.infra-entry-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.infra-entry-links a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;padding:15px;gap:5px 10px}.infra-entry-links small{grid-column:2}}</style>
